            "review_title": "Review at LA Rock Hanoi Restaurant & Coffee",
            "review_text": "DOUME\nAndresy, France765 contributions\n0\nReserve, especially on the price...\nOct 2023 • Family\nRestaurant near our hotel in old Hanoi...\nProbably a recent establishment... Large rooms on the ground floor and upstairs... Very designer modern decor...\nWelcome and attentive service but too reserved...\nVery extensive and varied menu...\nCareful and quality cuisine...\nAverage quality/price ratio...\nPlease note that drinks (beers and bottles of water on the tables) are charged at double the usual price, wet towels provided and appetizers served at the start of the meal are charged without prior notice...\nIn the end, a bill almost doubled compared to previous meals of similar quality...\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten November 18, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
